# palm_tall -- coconut palm, ~9m, gentle lean, 8-frond crown with coconuts at the base
# trunk: 5 tapered cylinder segments, each rolled to continue the curve from the last
# The trunk is solid; the orbit camera ignores colliders this thin so it does not bounce off palms.
collide 0.28 6.0
piece models/shapes/cylinder.obj   0.000 0.000 0.000   0.42 1.75 0.42   0 0 -1    1.68 1.48 1.16  tex palm_bark 1.0
piece models/shapes/cylinder.obj   0.031 1.750 0.000   0.38 1.70 0.38   0 0 -3    1.68 1.48 1.16  tex palm_bark 1.0
piece models/shapes/cylinder.obj   0.120 3.447 0.000   0.34 1.65 0.34   0 0 -6    1.68 1.48 1.16  tex palm_bark 1.0
piece models/shapes/cylinder.obj   0.292 5.088 0.000   0.31 1.60 0.31   0 0 -9    1.68 1.48 1.16  tex palm_bark 1.0
piece models/shapes/cylinder.obj   0.542 6.669 0.000   0.28 1.40 0.28   0 0 -13   1.68 1.48 1.16  tex palm_bark 1.0
# crown: 11 fronds, each an inner plank leaving the crown almost flat and an outer one
# hinged at its tip and drooping, so the silhouette arcs instead of spoking
